<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Raytheon raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Raytheon raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it upgraded Raytheon Co to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Raytheon on Thursday said it would buy the defense buinesses of Hughes Electronics, a General Motors Corp unit, for $9.5 billion.</p>
<p>-- Raytheon was up 1/2 at 49 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
